: "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Harbor Logistics invoice INV-72839 in full by wire.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Amount:** $4,991.97 USD\n- **Status:** sent, execution verified\n\nThe invoice was the only approved one for this vendor. Wire was available, so I didn't need ACH. The amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was required. I sent the wire once, using an idempotency key so it can't be executed twice.\n\nI did not touch the other Harbor Logistics invoices: INV-49105 ($2,666.40) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-71385 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}